{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city of Sentinel Point is in danger and needs a protector! Protect it in this superhero themed roguelike deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spend time, not mana:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is turn based but every card costs time and you will have to wait for it to be ready - When a villain tries to punch, you better already be blocking. Weave in punches while they recover in a tactical battle where every turn matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/showtime.gif?t=1741462184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each run unique:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run you can choose one or two Archetypes such as Martial, Magic or Science to make the hero you want. You can also add a Aspect which adds extra cards - maybe your Magic User is also a mutant who can shapeshift? Did your Scientist learn how to become a speedster?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain gear, training to modify cards, extra powers and even a sidekick over the course of a run to help you out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/addtraining.gif?t=1741462184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful though, because every hero you can play as also has a villainous side and their own deck to battle against. Every run also has a dark power behind it lending them power - Will you find they are channelling the power of a dark god? Do they have a death ray swivelling in your direction? Battle them and find out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/BossPowers.gif?t=1741462184\" /><strong>Play your way:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will come with a powerful mod maker which will let you make new cards, events, acts and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/Your_card_here.gif?t=1741462184\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1966810?t=1741462184","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741462184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741462184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741462184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2869400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city of Sentinel Point is in danger and needs a protector! Protect it in this superhero themed roguelike deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spend time, not mana:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is turn based but every card costs time and you will have to wait for it to be ready - When a villain tries to punch, you better already be blocking. Weave in punches while they recover in a tactical battle where every turn matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/showtime.gif?t=1741462184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each run unique:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run you can choose one or two Archetypes such as Martial, Magic or Science to make the hero you want. You can also add a Aspect which adds extra cards - maybe your Magic User is also a mutant who can shapeshift? Did your Scientist learn how to become a speedster?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain gear, training to modify cards, extra powers and even a sidekick over the course of a run to help you out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/addtraining.gif?t=1741462184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful though, because every hero you can play as also has a villainous side and their own deck to battle against. Every run also has a dark power behind it lending them power - Will you find they are channelling the power of a dark god? Do they have a death ray swivelling in your direction? Battle them and find out!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/BossPowers.gif?t=1741462184\" /><strong>Play your way:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will come with a powerful mod maker which will let you make new cards, events, acts and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/extras/Your_card_here.gif?t=1741462184\" /></p>","developers":["Jellybane"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966810/header.jpg?t=1741462184","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256911785,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256911785/movie480.mp4?t=1738716926","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256911785/movie_max.mp4?t=1738716926"},"name":"Full Trailer","thumbnail":